sequenceDiagram
 participant C as Customer
 participant W as Web application
 participant D as PostgreSQL
 participant P as Payment adapter
 C->>W: Cart, address, idempotency key
 W->>D: Begin; lock stock; validate eligibility
 W->>D: Reserve stock; create parent and suborders
 D-->>W: Commit pending order
 W->>P: Create payment outside DB transaction
 P-->>W: Payment reference
 P->>W: Payment event
 W->>W: Verify event, amount and currency
 W->>D: Lock order; deduplicate event ID
 alt Pending and verified success
 W->>D: Mark paid and reservations consumed
 else Pending and failed or expired
 W->>D: Release reservations exactly once
 else Late success after release
 W->>D: Flag reconciliation; no fulfilment
 end
 W-->>C: Current order and payment state
